# CartNomic environment example. Copy to .env.local only if you later add an optional adapter.
# The guest demo needs NONE of these. The app builds and runs with this file absent.
#
# WARNING: anything prefixed with VITE_ is compiled into the browser bundle and is PUBLIC.
# Never put a secret, a service role key, or a USDA API key in a VITE_ variable.
# A USDA FoodData Central key belongs on a server you control, never in frontend code.

# Optional, only if a Supabase adapter is added later and authorized separately.
# A publishable key is not the same thing as a privileged secret key.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
